Package: speaker
Type: Package
Title: Object-Oriented Interface to Praat Phonetic Analysis
Version: 0.4.9
Date: 2025-11-17
Authors@R: c(
    person("Fredrik", "Nylén", , "fredrik.nylen@umu.se", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3373-0934"))
    )
Maintainer: Fredrik Nylén <fredrik.nylen@umu.se>
Description: Provides direct, efficient access to Praat C implemented
    functionality from R using Rcpp. Similar in concept to the parselmouth
    package for Python, this package allows R users to leverage Praat's
    powerful phonetic analysis capabilities directly from R for sound object
    manipulation, pitch analysis, formant extraction, intensity measurements,
    and spectral analysis.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
